  "jcr:description": "The Audion Eustachian Tube dilation system is a balloon dilation device that aims to treat adults (18+) suffering from Eustachian tube dysfunction.¹ The FlexFeel technology and flexible design provide optimal feel while traversing the eustachian tube.² Balloon dilation of the eustachian tube may help to provide up to 29 months of relief, giving your patients comfort that lasts.⁵",
